Template: dfm-tools/restart-tray
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Restart dfm-tools tray application?
 Dfm-tools tray application is currently running. A restart is recommended
 to load the updated version with new features and fixes.
 .
 Restart the tray application now?
Template: dfm-tools/restart-tray-note
Type: note
Description: Dfm-tools has been updated
 Dfm-tools has been updated successfully. You can restart the tray
 application from its context menu to use the new version.
